    "heading": "Level 20: Words of Creation",
    "lineStart": 2530,
    "lineEnd": 2532
  },
  "section": "3.48",
  "rulesText": "You have mastered two of the Words of Creation: the words of life and death. You therefore always have the Power Word Heal and Power Word Kill spells prepared. When you cast either spell, you can target a second creature with it if that creature is within 10 feet of the first target."
}
